  0004-libcamera-Add-the-Samsung-S5KGN1-sensor.patch
  0005-libcamera-software_isp-add-contrast-autofocus.patch
  0006-software_isp-Focus-on-the-frame-centre-with-statisti.patch
  0007-software_isp-Steadier-contrast-autofocus.patch
  0008-software_isp-Keep-exposure-white-balance-and-focus-a.patch
  0009-software_isp-Take-contrast-and-saturation-defaults-f.patch
